# File Preview Sheet

::summary
The non-photo file preview sheet, opened from Files rows (Videos / Audio / Other segments): kind-size-uploaded meta, then Download, Copy link, Send in message, and the Move to trash danger row — always last.
::

::modal[name=file-preview title="store-listing-copy.pdf" width=360 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::row[icon=file state=readonly href=#]
Kind · Size · Uploaded
Document · 340 KB · Aug 01, 2026
:::

