::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon. Photos open `modals/photo-detail.surf` instead — this sheet serves every non-photo kind.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) this media sheet goes FULL-BLEED — edge-to-edge with no side insets, the preview area filling the viewport width — not the generic 10px-inset treatment; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
